      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `6ced404e2f78d71721a438c4f4af3ce89ebff748bfe93b5bcedb9d71416f2ea6--45150do001_201213.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Federal Defendants, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2012-13\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 5d974b717de92833d3e2d0422b802f4828e3116f59fabffaa22832309e3a2868 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 37a2b85f6b296d95232bcd1b60114c38f7e666ff1b631276e5e27034479b4e80 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 418b48f22f7b54fc2a6bb266b84449ebcd0f2deec0f4dbce20b0cb79748487da | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 9a06e76f0ca8e82f672ce9347e75b81f2ada8c5bd4f3ed40d0e8c977dd940f99 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 21a3a29ea380d0d823eddddfde77caad0995b5825b5e2985310c8b5a0dae31be | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | df9141216b0df8528bd13bd43d0af55c655e009493a54dba4a94cb4fe7c3b6b1 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | c298972e4f0369280211ba3880683d91134df716a111a87ece6fb191f6c7daf6 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 7e4f3bf2391ed5dfcb8b32bad799d3b7e7c4b8ef9cdcecdac5cf8b5ed662fe24 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 97badf603eafd3116121a61b3cfaf7f12a67a3bdd2b68d18efee591b664cbab3 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
